# Supports common IPv4 database layouts. Platform/version differences require local tests.
Value Required IP_ADDRESS (\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{1,3}){3})
Value MAC_ADDRESS ((?:[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}\.){2}[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}|(?:[0-9A-Fa-f]{2}:){5}[0-9A-Fa-f]{2})
Value VLAN (\d+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${VLAN}\s+${STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
